  "description": "A Modern Take on the Classic Steel Tourer with clearance for 45mm tyres (40mm with mudguards)\n\nBuilt with premium Columbus Zona tubing, the Shand Stoater is our response to the uninspiring steel touring bikes of the past. Designed to blend speed, stability, and load-carrying capability, the Stoater proves you no longer have to compromise performance for practicality.\n\nThanks to a carefully considered geometry and tubeset, the Stoater delivers a fast, confident ride whether you’re fully loaded on an Alpine tour or off the beaten track.. This is a truly versatile machine, capable of adapting to your riding needs year-round.\n\nAt its core, the Stoater frame is built around the flat mount disc brake standard, with a 12mm thru-axle up front and a Paragon Polydrop rear dropout. This modular dropout design allows for incredible drivetrain flexibility—compatible with Rohloff hubs, singlespeed setups, or a Gates Carbon Belt Drive, alongside traditional derailleur systems.\n\nWhether you’re exploring backroads, racing the seasons, or commuting with confidence, the Stoater is built to do it all—with style, speed, and reliability.\n\nMade for touring with luggage, commuting and year-round riding where comfort and carrying come first. If you want the lightest, quickest bike in the range, choose the Stramash or the Stooshie.",
